<section class="cp-topic" id="methodology-changelog">
<h2>Methodology changelog</h2>
<p>Every profile shows the methodology version it was built with, for example "Methodology version <em>N</em>". The version goes up only when the documented method changes in a way that moves figures, such as a new way of assigning people to flood zones or a different geography for totals. New source data and corrections to the code don’t change the version; they appear in the data changelog below. Figures built with different versions aren't directly comparable.</p>
